			</li>
			<li>
				Use automated means to scrape or abuse the Service beyond normal
				personal use.
			</li>
		</ul>
	</section>

	<section>
		<h2>5. Your data</h2>
		<p>
			You own the financial data you enter or import into Vezne. We
			process it to provide the Service to you, as described in the
			<a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> — including, if you choose
			to enable it, sending PDF bank statements to a third-party AI
			service to help parse them. That feature is off by default and
			only runs when you turn it on in Settings.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section>
		<h2>6. Fees</h2>
		<p>
			Vezne is currently free to use. If paid plans are introduced in
			the future, pricing and billing terms will be presented to you
			separately before any charge, and these Terms will be updated to
			reflect them.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section>
		<h2>7. Disclaimers and limitation of liability</h2>
		<p>
			The Service is provided "as is" and "as available," without
