			or consequential damages arising from your use of the Service,
			including decisions you make based on data you entered or
			imported. Always verify important financial figures against your
			bank's own records.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section>
		<h2>8. Termination</h2>
		<p>
			You may stop using the Service and delete your account at any
			time. We may suspend or terminate access if you violate these
			Terms or misuse the Service, and will make reasonable efforts to
			notify you where practical.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section>
		<h2>9. Changes to these Terms</h2>
		<p>
			We may update these Terms from time to time. If we make material
			changes, we'll update the "Last updated" date above and, where
			appropriate, notify you through the Service. Continuing to use
			Vezne after changes take effect means you accept the updated
